<section class="container" style="font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left;"><h1 class="h1" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 1em; border-bottom: 2px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em auto 1em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: 0 !important;">AI Agent三大趋势：从聊天到干活，从单打到组团</h1><blockquote class="blockquote" style="font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;"><p class="p" style="display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;">2026年，AI Agent彻底火了。从Claude Code到ChatGPT Agent，从Manus到企业级工作流平台，AI Agent正在从&quot;能聊天&quot;进化到&quot;会干活&quot;。MIT、哈佛、斯坦福等机构的最新研究揭示了AI Agent发展的三大硬核真相。</p></blockquote><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🔥 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">AI Agent的爆发元年</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">进入2026年，AI Agent成为科技圈最热的话题。根据麦肯锡的报告，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">62%的企业正在试水Agent</strong>。但真正的问题是——在真实工作场景里，Agent到底走到哪一步了？</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">最近，MIT、哈佛、斯坦福等机构的研究团队发布了一份《2025 AI Agent Index》。他们把市面上最具代表性的30个代理系统逐一拆开，设计了45个维度，仔细扒了扒这些产品的技术细节、部署情况、设计架构、工具使用和安全机制。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">透过这份报告，我们能看到当下Agent发展的三个硬核真相。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">📊 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">真相一：产品形态收拢在三个方向</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">大多数代理产品集中在2024–2025年发布。从产品形态看，AI代理基本收拢在了三个方向：</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">1. 聊天式代理（12个）</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：以对话为入口，挂载各种工具箱</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">代表</strong>：Claude、Gemini、ChatGPT等</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">优势</strong>：用户友好，学习成本低</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">局限</strong>：自主性相对较低</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">2. 企业自动化平台（13个）</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：主打B端工作流的自动化编排</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">代表</strong>：各种企业级工作流平台</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">优势</strong>：已经成为与聊天界面分庭抗礼的主流形态</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">应用</strong>：跨部门工作流自动化、信息研究与集成</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">3. 浏览器/GUI型Agent（5个）</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：直接接管屏幕，模拟人类点击和输入</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">代表</strong>：豆包手机等</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">优势</strong>：功能整合度更高</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特色</strong>：中国开发的GUI型代理更倾向于整合电话与电脑操作能力</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🎯 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">真相二：从行动空间到自主性，AI代理正在分化</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">虽然都叫&quot;Agent&quot;，但这30个产品的功能相差很大。其中，一个核心区别在于<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">行动空间</strong>。</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">企业工作流代理</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">行动方式</strong>：主要通过CRM、数据库等系统连接器来执行操作</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：更像企业流程里的自动执行节点</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">控制</strong>：行动空间通常被严格限制，优先设置工具权限与使用防护</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">命令行界面（CLI）代理</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">行动方式</strong>：直接操作文件系统和终端命令</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：能力更偏工程环境</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">应用</strong>：开发、运维等场景</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">浏览器代理</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">行动方式</strong>：点击、输入、导航网页</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：直接&quot;代替人类&quot;操作界面</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">自主性</strong>：通常达到L4–L5，自主性显著更高</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">自主性分层：从L1到L5</strong></h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">L1–L3：轮次式助手</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：每执行一组动作，便等待用户下一条指令</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">代表</strong>：Claude、Gemini、ChatGPT等</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">本质</strong>：仍以人类为中心，模型只是延长了操作链条</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">L4–L5：浏览器代理</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：一旦接收指令，便独立完成整个执行流程</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">控制权</strong>：在提交任务那一刻就已经让渡</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">优势</strong>：过程中几乎没有实时干预空间</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">企业级代理：设计阶段低自主，运行阶段高自主</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">设计阶段</strong>：用户通过可视化画布配置触发器、流程与防护规则</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">运行阶段</strong>：代理通常由邮件、数据库更新等事件自动触发</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">特点</strong>：运行时无需人工参与，进入L3–L5状态</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">⚠️ <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">真相三：自主性在变强，责任边界也在模糊</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">随着AI Agent能力提升，一系列新的挑战正在浮现。</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">身份披露问题</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">现状</strong>：21/30的代理默认不向终端用户或第三方披露自身的AI身份</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">问题</strong>：终端用户是否真正知道自己正在与AI互动？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">责任</strong>：企业平台往往将披露责任交给客户</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">技术识别挑战</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">现状</strong>：大部分浏览器代理通常无视robots.txt文件</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">逻辑</strong>：以&quot;代表用户&quot;身份运行</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">争议</strong>：代理绕过网络限制的趋势正在改变控制权结构</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">安全机制不均衡</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">审批机制</strong>：开发者或CLI类代理要求明确确认</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">控制节点</strong>：浏览器代理更多放在身份验证与支付环节</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">透明度差距</strong>：不同产品之间的透明度差距很大</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🔧 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">三大结构趋势</strong></h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">1. 安全披露高度不均</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">现状</strong>：仅有极少数代理发布针对自身架构的系统卡片</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">问题</strong>：能力基准与安全评估之间存在明显不对称</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">风险</strong>：仅依赖模型层面的文档已不足够</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">2. 基础模型高度集中</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">现状</strong>：几乎所有代理都依赖GPT、Claude或Gemini</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">优势</strong>：效率与评估便利</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">风险</strong>：单点风险，定价调整、服务中断或安全漏洞可能向下游系统扩散</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">3. 责任链条分散</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">结构</strong>：基础模型、编排层、构建平台、部署方、最终用户</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">问题</strong>：没有单一实体对完整行为负责</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">挑战</strong>：仅凭模型文档做安全判断，很容易形成虚假保障</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🚀 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">AI Agent的应用场景</strong></h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">按应用场景排名前三：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">信息研究与集成（12个）</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">跨部门工作流自动化（11个）</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">表单填写和预订等浏览器操作（7个）</strong></li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">企业场景特点：</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">画布式编排界面</strong>已成为标准</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">8/13的企业平台</strong>采用可视化流程组合界面</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">设计层强调流程构建</strong>，使用层强调自然语言</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">💡 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">给企业的建议</strong></h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">选择AI Agent的考虑因素：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">行动空间需求</strong>：需要代理操作什么系统？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">自主性要求</strong>：需要多大程度的自动化？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">安全要求</strong>：需要什么样的审批和监督机制？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">集成难度</strong>：现有系统能否顺利对接？</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">实施建议：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">从小处着手</strong>：从单一场景开始试点</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C8